I didn't mean to step on your
words, but it is, you know,

02:18:55.694 --> 02:18:58.496 align:start size:97% position:3%
the interpersonal
connection is so important.

02:18:58.496 --> 02:19:00.632
- Yeah, yeah. I think so, too.

02:19:00.632 --> 02:19:05.337
And it's, yeah...

02:19:07.472 --> 02:19:09.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, I'm excited to
talk to you more about it

02:19:09.741 --> 02:19:12.544
'cause essentially it's
a little bit contrary.

02:19:12.544 --> 02:19:15.180
Most people are like,
everybody's unique,

02:19:15.180 --> 02:19:16.414
everyone needs different things

02:19:16.414 --> 02:19:18.917 align:start size:84% position:16%
and this and that
and their philosophy.

02:19:19.784 --> 02:19:22.354
Dag and Dr. Monica is more like,

02:19:22.354 --> 02:19:25.590
actually we're a lot more
like cars than we think,

02:19:25.590 --> 02:19:30.362
and we should be able
support this structure

02:19:30.362 --> 02:19:34.132
and do this thing, and
there is a blueprint

02:19:34.132 --> 02:19:37.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we can if we
strengthen certain muscles

02:19:37.969 --> 02:19:40.171
that you didn't know you had.

02:19:40.171 --> 02:19:44.042 align:start size:81% position:19%
You can support
this, speaking of,

02:19:44.042 --> 02:19:47.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
you don't wanna be unique
when it comes to body

02:19:47.545 --> 02:19:48.980
and injury things.

02:19:48.980 --> 02:19:50.382 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think that's what's
been so comforting,

02:19:50.382 --> 02:19:51.750
is they're like, no
you're not unique.

02:19:51.750 --> 02:19:53.985
- Well, we all have the
same bones and muscles,

02:19:53.985 --> 02:19:57.288 align:start size:84% position:16%
we start there.
- Exactly. Exactly.

02:19:57.288 --> 02:19:59.491
So it's been really helpful.

02:19:59.491 --> 02:20:01.993
And I like working with people

02:20:01.993 --> 02:20:04.529
who have a diverse perspective.

02:20:04.529 --> 02:20:07.499
So like a lot of
the work they do

02:20:07.499 --> 02:20:10.301
is with tennis players
and football players.

02:20:10.301 --> 02:20:13.705
And I think I've worked with
a lot of running specialist

02:20:13.705 --> 02:20:15.373
people and that's been helpful,

02:20:15.373 --> 02:20:19.177 align:start size:97% position:3%
but sometimes it's refreshing
to step outside and just-

02:20:19.177 --> 02:20:20.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
- Mix it up a little bit.
